000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. OPEN1.
000030 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000040 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000050 FILE-CONTROL.
000060     SELECT LOG-A ASSIGN TO "open-a.txt"
000070         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000080     SELECT LOG-B ASSIGN TO "open-b.txt"
000090         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000100     SELECT OPTIONAL EXTRA ASSIGN TO "open-c.txt"
000110         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
000120         FILE STATUS IS EXTRA-STATUS.
000130 DATA DIVISION.
000140 FILE SECTION.
000150 FD  LOG-A.
000160 01  A-LINE              PIC X(10).
000170 FD  LOG-B.
000180 01  B-LINE              PIC X(10).
000190 FD  EXTRA.
000200 01  EXTRA-LINE          PIC X(10).
000210 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000220 01  EXTRA-STATUS        PIC XX.
000230 01  END-FLAG            PIC X.
000240 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000250     OPEN OUTPUT LOG-A LOG-B
000260     MOVE "A FIRST" TO A-LINE WRITE A-LINE
000270     MOVE "B FIRST" TO B-LINE WRITE B-LINE
000280     CLOSE LOG-A LOG-B
000290     OPEN EXTEND LOG-A
000300     MOVE "A SECOND" TO A-LINE WRITE A-LINE
000310     CLOSE LOG-A
000320     OPEN OUTPUT LOG-B
000330     MOVE "B NEW" TO B-LINE WRITE B-LINE
000340     CLOSE LOG-B
000350     OPEN INPUT LOG-A LOG-B
000360     MOVE "N" TO END-FLAG
000370     PERFORM UNTIL END-FLAG = "Y"
000380         READ LOG-A AT END MOVE "Y" TO END-FLAG
000390             NOT AT END DISPLAY "LOG-A: " A-LINE
000400         END-READ
000410     END-PERFORM
000420     MOVE "N" TO END-FLAG
000430     PERFORM UNTIL END-FLAG = "Y"
000440         READ LOG-B AT END MOVE "Y" TO END-FLAG
000450             NOT AT END DISPLAY "LOG-B: " B-LINE
000460         END-READ
000470     END-PERFORM
000480     CLOSE LOG-A LOG-B
000490     OPEN INPUT EXTRA
000500     DISPLAY "OPTIONAL FILE MISSING: " EXTRA-STATUS
000510     READ EXTRA
000520     DISPLAY "FIRST READ: " EXTRA-STATUS
000530     CLOSE EXTRA
000540     STOP RUN.
